1
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,280
I don't even want a salary.

2
00:00:55,039 --> 00:00:56,320
I just want to work with you.

3
00:00:56,439 --> 00:00:57,240
Is that okay,

4
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,159
Boss Dawei?

5
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,280
Of course you can!

6
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,079
Uncle Dong and I were just planning

7
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:06,239
to open a Jinhua Garment Factory counter

8
00:01:06,239 --> 00:01:08,000
in the city's most upscale mall.

9
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,159
Sister-in-law,

10
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:11,120
get ready to be a top manager!

11
00:01:14,439 --> 00:01:15,040
Take a look.

12
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,879
I designed another new summer outfit.

13
00:01:18,799 --> 00:01:20,480
You'll have to model it again this time.

14
00:01:22,079 --> 00:01:23,400
It'll definitely look great on me.

15
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:25,519
I'll do this myself.

16
00:01:25,519 --> 00:01:26,359
This is men's clothing.

17
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,359
Brother Sun.

18
00:01:31,159 --> 00:01:31,799
Qianqian.

19
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,879
You came all the way to see me today.

20
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,280
Not just to bring me two boxes of tea,

21
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,280
is it?

22
00:01:36,799 --> 00:01:37,879
Oh, come on.

23
00:01:38,519 --> 00:01:40,120
Xiaofang and I were classmates,

24
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,439
and our families live so close.

25
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:42,439
To me,

26
00:01:42,439 --> 00:01:43,840
you've always been like an older brother.

27
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:46,840
I just heard some rumors recently

28
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,319
and didn't want you to get burned.

29
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,719
Didn't want me to get burned?

30
00:01:50,719 --> 00:01:51,239
What's going on?

31
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:54,920
I heard our mall is currently reviewing

32
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,319
Jinhua Garment Factory's application.

33
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:57,920
That's right.

34
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,560
I heard their recent batch of clothes

35
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,480
has been selling really well.

36
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,599
Not only are the styles fresh,

37
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:03,280
but the customer conversion rate is high.

38
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,319
Yunding

39
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:05,040
really needs

40
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:08,000
a rising brand that draws foot traffic.

41
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:09,960
How did you find out about this?

42
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,479
I know their negotiator,

43
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:13,520
Ma Dawei.

44
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:17,319
I really shouldn't be saying this,

45
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,319
but if you're going to work with Ma Dawei,

46
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:20,800
you have to be careful.

47
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:21,919
Why? What's wrong?

48
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:25,159
I'm not afraid to admit it,

49
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,039
but he and I used to be

50
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,719
in a relationship.

51
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:31,840
He does have some business sense,

52
00:02:32,159 --> 00:02:33,639
but for a scumbag who

53
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:35,560
would cross any line for money...

54
00:02:35,879 --> 00:02:37,599
can the quality of his clothes

55
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:38,879
really be trusted?

56
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,639
I'm just worried

57
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:41,639
that when the time comes,

58
00:02:41,639 --> 00:02:43,479
he'll cause trouble for our mall

59
00:02:43,919 --> 00:02:44,919
and ruin our reputation.

60
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:48,719
Th-This guy's character is that bad?

61
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:52,080
Then I need to seriously reconsider this.

62
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:54,759
Besides, I also heard

63
00:02:54,879 --> 00:02:56,879
that he and his sister-in-law, Su Hui,

64
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:59,120
have a complicated relationship.

65
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,560
Ma Dawei's sister-in-law is Su Hui?

66
00:03:04,479 --> 00:03:05,560
I totally forgot!

67
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:09,080
Were you two high school classmates?

68
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,599
Go on, keep talking.

69
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,240
What about Ma Dawei and his sister-in-law?

70
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:16,680
Ever since Ma Dawei's older brother died,

71
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:19,520
he's been living with his sister-in-law.

72
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:21,439
The neighbors are gossiping about them.

73
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:23,039
I didn't believe it at first,

74
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,680
until...

75
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:27,479
...I kept seeing them all over each other.

76
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:28,960
Su Hui...

77
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:31,800
I made moves on you again and again,

78
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,199
yet you never gave me the time of day.

79
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,280
So that's why...

80
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:37,120
Fine.

81
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:38,800
I get the picture now.

82
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,439
As long as I'm here,

83
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:44,080
Jinhua will never enter Yunding Department Store!

84
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,879
Still, their factory's sales figures

85
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:48,120
are just too impressive.

86
00:03:48,719 --> 00:03:50,039
Even the group's president

87
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:51,479
has heard about them.

88
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,240
If I kill this project unilaterally,

89
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,360
I'll need solid evidence

90
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:58,400
to prove that Ma Dawei and Jinhua

91
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:01,280
pose massive commercial risks.

92
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,879
Brother Sun,

93
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:07,599
Dong Nan, the factory director's daughter,

94
00:04:07,599 --> 00:04:08,520
is someone I know.

95
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,800
She knows Ma Dawei pretty well.

96
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,400
You could talk to her.

97
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,439
If even his own partner

98
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:16,079
thinks his character is compromised,

99
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:18,839
it will directly damage his credibility.

100
00:04:19,639 --> 00:04:21,959
I'm sure your superiors

101
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:24,720
will definitely want to avoid that risk.

102
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:28,680
Young people really do have sharp minds!

103
00:04:34,839 --> 00:04:35,439
Hello?

104
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,240
What?

105
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:42,439
See Manager Sun at Yunding Department Store?

106
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,720
All right, okay. Got it.

107
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:54,680
Ma Dawei, oh, Ma Dawei.

108
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:55,519
Without you,

109
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:58,319
a troublemaking scumbag in my way,

110
00:04:58,439 --> 00:04:59,399
I can still

111
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,560
land the Yunding Department Store deal

112
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,720
and get it signed!

113
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:09,720
Manager Sun,

114
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:11,560
here are our latest sample fabrics

115
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,399
and production credentials.

116
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:13,399
Please have a look.

117
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:14,279
Xiao Dong,

118
00:05:14,399 --> 00:05:15,160
have a seat, please.

119
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,879
No need to check the fabrics.

120
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,120
I trust Jinhua Garment Factory's quality.

121
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:21,399
We're not here today

122
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:22,439
to talk business.

123
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,680
Just having a private chat.

124
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,040
A private chat?

125
00:05:25,839 --> 00:05:26,959
Qianqian told me

126
00:05:26,959 --> 00:05:28,120
you two are friends.

127
00:05:28,759 --> 00:05:29,839
Give it to me straight.

128
00:05:30,319 --> 00:05:31,680
That Ma Dawei...

129
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,600
is he actually reliable?

130
00:05:34,079 --> 00:05:35,079
Ma Dawei?

131
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,560
I heard he has a really shady background.

132
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,519
Not only does he owe loan sharks a fortune,

133
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,560
which could blow up at any moment,

134
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,399
but he even used Qianqian's future

135
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:45,720
to threaten her into sleeping with him.

136
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,199
That's right.

137
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,639
This guy, Ma Dawei,

138
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:54,439
he's absolute scum.

139
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:55,680
The things he's done,

140
00:05:55,839 --> 00:05:57,199
everyone in our area knows about them.

141
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:59,439
Not only does he lie through his teeth,

142
00:05:59,439 --> 00:06:00,120
but when it comes to money,

143
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,319
he'd stoop to any vile trick.

144
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:03,639
What happened with Qianqian is proof!

145
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:04,759
To be honest,

146
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:06,079
if it weren't for his designs,

147
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:07,759
I would've kicked him out long ago.

148
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:16,600
Of course.

149
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:19,120
I know when partnering with our factory,

150
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,680
what matters most is the product, right?

151
00:06:22,199 --> 00:06:24,199
Ma Dawei may have terrible character,

152
00:06:24,399 --> 00:06:26,000
but the factory belongs to the Dong family.

153
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:27,399
And as for quality control,

154
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:28,800
I've always been the one overseeing it.

155
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,240
So when it comes to clothing quality,

156
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,160
there's absolutely no issue.

157
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:31,800
You can rest assured.

158
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,079
As for Ma Dawei,

159
00:06:34,759 --> 00:06:36,319
you can completely ignore him.

160
00:06:39,519 --> 00:06:40,319
Good.

161
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,480
Hearing that puts my mind at ease.

162
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,160
Tell you what,

163
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,319
you can head back for now.

164
00:06:48,519 --> 00:06:50,560
Regarding the letter of intent,

165
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:52,759
Well,

166
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:54,959
I'll notify you after a full evaluation.

167
00:06:55,879 --> 00:06:57,079
I have another meeting soon,

168
00:06:57,879 --> 00:06:58,759
so I won't walk you out.

169
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:20,040
Dad,

170
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,000
they said the final payment

171
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,160
will be transferred in a couple of days.

172
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,199
Dawei, you're back.

173
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:26,600
The counter at Yunding Department Store...

174
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,399
did we secure it?

175
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:32,560
Dong Nan,

176
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:34,199
have you lost your mind?

177
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:35,560
What the hell is wrong with you?

178
00:07:35,839 --> 00:07:37,519
So what if you couldn't close the deal?

179
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:38,759
Why are you taking it out on me?

180
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,720
That Manager Sun

181
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,800
suddenly refused to lease to us.

182
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:43,120
He said Jinhua's external lead, Ma Dawei,

183
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,199
has terrible credit

184
00:07:44,279 --> 00:07:45,720
and poses a huge commercial risk.

185
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:48,120
They found out through a background check,

186
00:07:48,879 --> 00:07:50,319
and the person who leaked that information

187
00:07:50,519 --> 00:07:51,879
was Jinhua's deputy director,

188
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:53,240
Miss Dong Nan herself!

189
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:58,079
Nannan,

190
00:07:58,560 --> 00:08:01,000
did you have something to do with this?

191
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:06,639
Dad, Manager Sun asked me directly.

192
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:07,680
Was I supposed to lie?

193
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,120
You...

194
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,319
Dong Nan!

195
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,720
You took your bestie's sob-story script

196
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:17,199
and played moral judge for our partner!

197
00:08:17,639 --> 00:08:19,480
Are our factory's profits so high

198
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,759
that money's burning your pockets?

199
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:22,680
Nannan,

200
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,040
By doing this, aren't you

201
00:08:24,319 --> 00:08:26,680
taking away all our workers' livelihood?

202
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,919
Dad!

203
00:08:33,279 --> 00:08:34,919
Those are two separate matters.

204
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,399
Our factory doesn't

205
00:08:36,399 --> 00:08:38,039
have to tie itself to Ma Dawei!

206
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,720
We guarantee product quality,

207
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:40,679
but we can't possibly

208
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:42,320
endorse his personal conduct!

209
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:45,039
If he did it, why can't we talk about it?

210
00:08:46,919 --> 00:08:47,519
Fine.

211
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:48,559
Dong Nan,

212
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:50,320
you're a good girl,

213
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:52,200
but you're not cut out for business.

214
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,000
Starting tomorrow,

215
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,320
stay out of all external operations,

216
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,279
and stick to fabric quality inspection.

217
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:59,519
If your self-righteous morality

218
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:01,559
costs this factory a single cent more,

219
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:02,759
Uncle Dong,

220
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,679
I'll have your daughter pack up and leave,

221
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:09,080
to clutch her pure conscience for life!

222
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,000
Dawei!

223
00:09:16,399 --> 00:09:17,120
Dawei!

224
00:09:17,639 --> 00:09:18,440
Dawei!

225
00:09:23,519 --> 00:09:24,399
Could it be...

226
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:27,600
I was really in the wrong?

227
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:32,480
About entering the department store...

228
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,240
I only ever told Qianqian.
